    "### Optimization Algorithms That Become Practical\n",
    "\n",
    "With ML surrogates, sophisticated optimization algorithms become feasible:\n",
    "\n",
    "**1. Genetic Algorithms with Large Populations**\n",
    "- Population size: 1000 (vs. 50-100 previously)\n",
    "- Generations: 5000 (vs. 100-200 previously)\n",
    - Elitism and crossover strategies\n",
    "- Multi-objective Pareto front exploration\n",
    "\n",
    "**2. Particle Swarm Optimization**\n",
    "- Swarm size: 500 particles\n",
    "- Iterations: 10,000\n",
    "- Dynamic parameter adaptation\n",
    "- Constraint handling mechanisms\n",
    "\n",
    "**3. Simulated Annealing with Detailed Exploration**\n",
    "- Temperature schedules with 1M+ evaluations\n",
    "- Multiple restarts for global optimization\n",
    "- Adaptive neighborhood search\n",
    "- Constraint-aware acceptance criteria"
   ]
